===Etymology 1===
{{slim-wikipedia|lang=en}}
{{multiple images
|direction = vertical
|image1 = Haggis at a Burns Supper.JPG
|caption1 = A whole haggis at a {{w|Burns supper}}
|image2 = Haggis neeps and tatties.jpg
|caption2 = Haggis ''(top left)'' served with [[neeps]] and [[tatties]] ([[mashed#Adjective|mashed]] [[swede]] and [[potato]]es; ''bottom and top right'')
